OL,3,GNEWSAVulnerable at risk as
OL,4,A'life-saving' drug needle site closes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA drug needle exchange in Belfast is
OL,7,Fset to close within days because the
OL,8,Fcharity which runs the service is
OL,9,Flosing its city centre premises.
OL,11,FThe exchange, run by Extern, allowed
OL,12,Fpeople who inject heroin or cocaine to
OL,13,Fsafely dispose used needles, receive
OL,14,Fclean needles and access health
OL,15,Fservices.
OL,17,FThe service will shut on 2 November and
OL,18,Fmove to a "significantly reduced
OL,19,Fstreet-based service" following the
OL,20,Floss of Extern's Royal Avenue premises.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
