OL,3,GNEWSAVulnerable at risk as
OL,4,A'life-saving' drug needle site closes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity described the needle
OL,7,Fexchange as a "life-saving service" and
OL,8,Fwarned that its closure meant
OL,9,Fvulnerable people would have "nowhere
OL,10,Fto go" to access support.
